POST      /verify/*ignore          uk.gov.hmrc.nddsstub.bars.BarsStubController.verify(ignore)

POST      /rate-limited-allow-list/services/:ignore1/features/:ignore2   uk.gov.hmrc.nddsstub.allowList.RateLimitedAllowListController.verify(ignore1, ignore2)
